00:57.020 --> 01:00.804
one small part of your business, it will
have the context of your entire business.

01:01.050 --> 01:03.604
You can think of it as an
operating system on your computer,

01:03.943 --> 01:05.420
which hosts all your apps.

01:05.697 --> 01:10.066
So in a similar fashion, the AI
operating system holds all your business

01:10.128 --> 01:14.481
processes, all the tools you use, and
combines them into one coherent system

01:14.668 --> 01:18.483
And the benefits of having an AI operating
system like this is that AI truly

01:18.637 --> 01:20.283
understands your business as a whole.

01:20.576 --> 01:23.683
It can look at your revenue numbers,
it can look at your marketing, your

01:23.899 --> 01:27.222
